# Production build config for the web SPA (loaded by Vite during `vite build`).
# NON-SECRET values only — everything here is inlined into the public client
# bundle. Secrets (the Supabase anon key, etc.) stay as Vercel project env vars,
# NOT here.
#
# VITE_API_BASE_URL points the browser at the API's own origin (Fly). Without it
# the client falls back to window.location.origin (the Vercel domain), which has
# no API — so this must be set for production. If you ever also set this in the
# Vercel dashboard, that value wins (Vite gives process env precedence over
# .env files); keep it in one place to avoid confusion.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://od-amrita-api.fly.dev
